---
---

<section>
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-slate-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Work & Internship</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Professional industry experience and internships</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Work Entry 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-700 font-bold text-xl overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551434678-e076c223a692?q=80&w=200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Company Logo" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Software Engineering Intern</h3>
                        <p class="text-brand-purple font-semibold text-sm">Tech Solutions Indonesia</p>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">Jun 2025 - Aug 2025 • Full-time</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-50 text-brand-blue self-start">
                    IT & Web Development
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-2">
                <p>• Developed and optimized responsive frontend components using React and Tailwind CSS for the client dashboard portal.</p>
                <p>• Collaborated with backend engineers to integrate RESTful API endpoints and resolve cross-browser rendering issues.</p>
                <p class="text-slate-900 font-semibold"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></i>Key Achievement: Improved web performance score by 35% and reduced load times across core pages.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Work Entry 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-700 font-bold text-xl overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572021335469-31706a17aaef?q=80&w=200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Studio Logo" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">UI/UX & Web Designer Intern</h3>
                        <p class="text-brand-purple font-semibold text-sm">Creative Digital Studio</p>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">Jan 2025 - May 2025 • Part-time</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-50 text-brand-purple self-start">
                    UI/UX & Design
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-2">
                <p>• Conducted user research and designed high-fidelity wireframes, interactive prototypes, and design tokens in Figma.</p>
                <p>• Created marketing visual kits, social media promo graphics, and video teasers for brand campaign launches.</p>
                <p class="text-slate-900 font-semibold"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></i>Key Achievement: Successfully delivered 4 client design systems with a 95%+ client approval rate.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
